|  0F   |  ->  | SP               | SP            |                                                   |
|  11   |  ->  | STR              | STR           |                                                   |
|  13   |  ->  | IC               | IC            |                                                   |
|  15   |  ->  | CSBR             | SSBR          |                                                   |
|  17   |  ->  | TSR0             | TSR1          |                                                   |
|  19   |  ->  | NPP              | 0(パディング) |                                                   |
